      "subject_newsroom_count": 26,
      "summary": "Germany has accused Russia of being responsible for a failed attack using an explosive-laden drone at Leipzig airport earlier this month, describing the incident as an attempted terrorist or “hybrid” operation and saying it will take retaliatory measures and raise the matter with NATO. Reported accounts indicate German authorities blamed Russian agents for directing or supplying the operation and characterized some operatives as disposable, but the articles do not provide independent verification of Russia’s involvement."
